@@ -0,0 +1,149 @@
+/*
+ * Per-folder sort order of the shell view
+ *
+ * The column and direction a folder was last sorted by are kept in
+ * HKCU\Software\Wine\Shell\FolderSort, one value per folder named after its
+ * desktop-absolute parsing name. Only folders the user sorted get a value;
+ * the oldest ones are dropped beyond MAX_FOLDERS.
+ *
